        "text": "<thinking> To create the `upload_object.py` file that uploads a file or byte stream to managed object storage, I need to choose a concrete external provider. Amazon S3 is a widely used managed object storage service, and I will use its SDK, `boto3`, to interact with it. The code will include the import of `boto3` and the use of Amazon S3-specific methods to upload objects. </thinking>\n",
